// Time (M6 Task 10).
//
// `now()` and `sleep(ms)` are not provided yet. Both need a runtime entry point
// -- a clock and a blocking wait -- and the runtime does not expose one; a
// wrapper that returned a constant or spun the CPU would be worse than an
// honest absence.
//
// The names are documented here rather than defined so that a program written
// against the planned surface fails at the call site, not at the import: the
// module itself is importable today.
//
// Ownership: nothing is created or consumed.
